atform using custom Triton kernels and fused pipelines. Powered by $CUTEDSL on Solana.","url":"https://cutedsl.cc","codeRepository":"https://github.com/lee101/cutedsl","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Applied Science Company","url":"https://app.nz"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","priceCurrency":"USD","description":"Pay-per-use AI inference with $CUTEDSL tokens"},"sameAs":["https://github.com/lee101/cutedsl"]}</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="font-nunito antialiased bg-pink-50 text-slate-800 selection:bg-pink-300 selection:text-pink-900"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white"><nav class="w-full p-6 flex justify-between items-center max-w-7xl mx-auto"><a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="/"><img alt="CuteDSL" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-lg" style="color:transparent" src="https://appstatic.app.nz/cutedsl/images/logo.webp"/><span class="font-fredoka text-3xl font-bold text-pink-600">CuteDSL</span></a><div class="flex gap-6 font-bold text-slate-700"><a class="hover:text-pink-500 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1" href="/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg> Home</a><a class="hover:text-cyan-500 transition-colors" href="/evals">Evals</a><a class="hover:text-purple-500 transition-colors" href="/blog">Blog</a></div></nav><main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24"><div class="py-12"><h1 class="font-fredoka text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">API Documentation</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl">All CuteDSL services use a single unified endpoint. Authenticate with your API key, specify the service, and send your request.</p></div><section class="mb-16"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key text-pink-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.5 7.5 2.3 2.3a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l2.1-2.1a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.4L19 4"></path><path d="m21 2-9.6 9.6"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="5.5"></circle></svg> Authentication</h2><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock text-slate-400 mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg><div><p class="text-slate-600 mb-2">Connect your Solana wallet on the <a class="text-pink-500 hover:text-pink-700 underline" href="/">homepage</a> to get your API key.</p><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Once connected, your real API key will automatically replace <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded text-xs">YOUR_API_KEY</code> in all code examples on this page.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="mb-16"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open text-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg> Quick Start</h2><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm"><p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">All services share a single endpoint: <code class="bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-bold">POST /api/service</code></p><pre class="hljs rounded-xl p-5 text-sm overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed shadow-sm "><code class="language-bash">curl -X POST https://cutedsl.cc/api/service \
frontend/out/api-docs.html:12:<span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></code></pre><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm"><div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-3"><span class="font-bold text-red-700">401</span> <span class="text-red-600">— Invalid or missing API key</span></div><div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-lg p-3"><span class="font-bold text-orange-700">402</span> <span class="text-orange-600">— Insufficient $CUTEDSL credits</span></div></div></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6">Available Services</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/zimage"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-pink-100 text-pink-700">Image</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Z-Image Turbo</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Text-to-image generation powered by CuteZImage with fused Triton kernels. Generates high-quality 1024x1024 images in seconds.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$1.00 per generation</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/chronos2"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700">Time Series</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Chronos-2</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Time series forecasting with CuteChronos2 acceleration. Achieves 27x speedup over baseline with custom Triton kernels.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.50 per forecast</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/tts"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700">Audio</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Kokoro TTS</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">High-quality text-to-speech with 20+ voices powered by Kokoro. Natural-sounding speech synthesis with adjustable speed.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.10 per 100 characters</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/stt"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700">Audio</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Speech-to-Text</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Audio transcription powered by Gemma4. Accurately transcribes speech from audio URLs with support for multiple languages.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.20 per minute</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/gemma4"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700">Text</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Gemma4 Chat</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Gemma4 26B multimodal LLM for chat and vision tasks. Supports OpenAI-compatible message format with text and image inputs.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.05 per request</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/caption"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700">Text</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Image Caption</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Automatic image captioning powered by GitBase. Generates descriptive captions for any image URL.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.05 per image</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/ltx_video"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-orange-100 text-orange-700">Video</span><span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">via proxy</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">LTX Video</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Text-to-video generation using LTX 2.3. Creates ~6 second 1080p videos at 25fps from text prompts.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.30 per ~6s video</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/flux_image"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-pink-100 text-pink-700">Image</span><span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">via proxy</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Flux Schnell</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Fast image generation using Flux Schnell via fal.ai. Produces 1024x1024 images with minimal latency.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$0.04 per image</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pink-300 transition-all" href="/docs/lora_training"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700">Training</span></div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-1 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">LoRA Training</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3 line-clamp-2">Fine-tune models with LoRA adapters. Train custom adapters for Z-Image or Chronos-2 on your own data.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">$50.00 per training job</span><span class="text-pink-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></div></a></div></section></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-842f2445eecd28fd.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[3616,[\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-3649eaaa321dae37.js\"],\"FrontendErrorReporter\"]\n3:I[9766,[],\"\"]\n4:I[8924,[],\"\"]\n5:I[1959,[],\"ClientPageRoot\"]\n6:I[4248,[\"67\",\"static/chunks/67-b81db0d4b3dd4d26.js\",\"29\",\"static/chunks/29-566013fdb92e5652.js\",\"476\",\"static/chunks/476-b9f0a15c2e721df4.js\",\"248\",\"static/chunks/248-183dd8b303465167.js\",\"287\",\"static/chunks/app/api-docs/page-58c6ed27745e2f09.js\"],\"default\"]\n9:I[4431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nb:I[5278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\nd:I[4431,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nf:I[4431,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n10:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n12:I[7150,[],\"\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/bca7023bf625e650-s.p.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/ee40bb094c99a29a-s.p.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/1f4204f5c3bcf089.css\",\"style\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"3ps503Q_81c2M6szSiKjJ\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"api-docs\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"api-docs\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\"