x items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700">Time Series</span></div><h1 class="font-fredoka text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3">Chronos-2</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl">Time series forecasting with CuteChronos2 acceleration. Achieves 27x speedup over baseline with custom Triton kernels.</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-pink-600">$0.50 per forecast</p></div><section class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">Parameters</h2><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200"><th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600">Parameter</th><th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600">Type</th><th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600">Required</th><th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600">Default</th><th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="bg-white"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono text-pink-600 font-bold">values</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-slate-500">float[]</td><td class="px-5 py-3"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold text-xs">required</span></td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">—</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-slate-600">Array of historical time series values</td></tr><tr class="bg-slate-50/50"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono text-pink-600 font-bold">prediction_length</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-slate-500">int</td><td class="px-5 py-3"><span class="text-slate-400 text-xs">optional</span></td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">12</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-slate-600">Number of future time steps to forecast</td></tr><tr class="bg-white"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono text-pink-600 font-bold">quantile_levels</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-slate-500">float[]</td><td class="px-5 py-3"><span class="text-slate-400 text-xs">optional</span></td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">—</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-slate-600">Quantile levels for prediction intervals</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="mb-12"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Example Request</h2><button class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-pink-500 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg> Copy</button></div><pre class="hljs rounded-xl p-5 text-sm overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6"><code class="language-bash">curl -X POST https://cutedsl.cc/api/service \
