The failure is reproducible locally with the logged request: the image process is deliberately started with `LOAD_CHRONOS=0`, so `/forecast_batch` returns `503 chronos2 disabled`. The deeper issue is that the autofix monitor treats every inference 5xx as an image-endpoint incident and the formatter also misses the logged `prompt_sha256` field; I’m going to harden that path without changing image generation semantics.
